<https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.24305436> schema:description "Idealised reconstruction of a stepped LEGO pyramid with four grey stair arms (seven levels) and a small temple with four corner pillars on top, a hobby build by Daria Stefan (TU Wien), rebuilt procedurally from clean LEGO bricks after a KIRI Engine scan. Only dimensions and structure were read from the scan; no scan mesh or texture was reused. AI disclosure: the reconstruction was generated with Claude (Anthropic, claude-sonnet-5-5) on behalf of Florian Thiery. It is an interpretation model, not a measurement." .
